{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just\/share()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO4JustV","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"share()","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113","fileName":"ShareSequence.swift"},"extendedModule":"_Concurrency"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just\/share()"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","title":"Afluent","role":"collection"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncSequences"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","title":"AsyncSequences","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncSequences"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Just":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Just"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Just"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Just","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/just","title":"AsyncSequences.Just","abstract":[{"text":"An async sequence that emits a single specified element and then completes.","type":"text"}]}